WEBVTT

00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:14,340
I used about the best time to take my ivervectin and fed-bed dissolved. I had been trying to space my

00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:20,260
dose about 12 hours apart, and you commented that it may be best to take the ivervectin and fed-bed

00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:27,380
dissolved separately. So I tried to space them a few hours apart at that. Now I'm reading that I should

00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:34,900
be taking these with food. My eating window is typically nude to seven. So should I take the protocol

00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,180
at nude and at seven? Or should I ignore my eating window and just take a bit of food with these doses

00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:46,180
that are approximately 12 hours apart? And do I still do the bulk of my eating in my seven-hour

00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:55,010
window? Yeah. So it's hard. Do I think you should take fed-bed dissolved in ivervectin? First of all,

00:00:55,010 --> 00:01:01,650
at the same time. Now maybe I commented that you should split them apart, but that was just an

00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:09,170
option. So I don't know that you can't take them together. Like if I'm taking 50 milligrams of

00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:14,930
ivervectin and 22 milligrams of fed-bed dissolved, could I literally swallow them at the same time?

00:01:15,970 --> 00:01:23,570
I think so. I don't, you know, obviously I think it's better with all your supplements if you can split

00:01:23,570 --> 00:01:31,490
them up a little bit. But we have to live in the real world, too. And you have to look at the benefit

00:01:31,490 --> 00:01:36,610
of, you know, I take it, you're talking about an eating window, you're talking about time-restricted

00:01:36,610 --> 00:01:43,810
eating or intermittent fasting that you're trying to stick to. Now I will say that sometimes people

00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:50,690
that don't take that take fed-bed dissolved, at least at an empty stomach, can feel a little

00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:57,250
yucky because it can maybe upset their tummy a little bit. I've had that happen. I also think that

00:01:57,330 --> 00:02:03,810
fed-bed dissolved has been shown that it is better absorbed if you take it with a fat because it's

00:02:03,810 --> 00:02:13,490
not water, real water soluble. It's more fat soluble drug. So yeah, you kind of got to weigh these

00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:21,410
things out and what's going to be best for you. It sounds like you're taking the ivervectin and fed-bed

00:02:21,490 --> 00:02:31,810
dissolved twice per day according to this question. So yeah, I would say you want to make sure you're

00:02:31,810 --> 00:02:37,970
not feeling sick from the fed-bed dissolved or the ivervectin. So eating some food and maybe getting

00:02:37,970 --> 00:02:42,610
some fat in your food for better absorption, that would be more important than your eating window.

00:02:42,610 --> 00:02:55,010
So I think that's what I would do is I would eat something with your dosage.

